{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082980/extras/77e400308dbdf7c47004f25bc92362a6.webp?t=1761898670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082980/extras/77e400308dbdf7c47004f25bc92362a6.poster.avif?t=1761898670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1024 height=1024 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Trapped: Forced to Kill?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TFTK is a psychological horror, mystery, and dark romance visual novel with over six different endings. You play as Ciara Mori. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve received an invitation to the best month of your life -\u00a0<strong>Evercrest Youth Retreat</strong>, where only the luckiest and most talented people are chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive just as the invitation says, enter the ominous door\u2026 and then everything becomes a blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're now tied up in a strange, dream-like place, that looks nothing like a Retreat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once freed, you discover you\u2019re trapped with <strong>eleven strangers</strong>, all as confused and terrified as you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form bonds, interact with your surroundings, make difficult choices and partake in a variety of <strong>twisted Killing Games</strong>\u2014from role-based card games to torture challenges, sacrifice activities, and trust-testing trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Evercrest Youth Retreat\u00a0</strong>has it all\u2026 and it wants you to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the fear, sparks of <strong>forbidden romance</strong> ignite- particularly between the protagonist and one of the players - Ash. Romance is strictly forbidden here, but will they find a way around it? And will they be able to escape and live happily ever after together? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lurking behind it all is your captor, Akira, whose motives are cruel, cunning...and strangely personal. Could Ciara Mori's past hold the key to his obsession?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face despair, heartbreak, and the dark allure of love in a place built to destroy you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the games, survive your choices, and uncover the truth\u2026 about the school, your captor, and even yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> to support development and be the first to experience the full story &lt;3</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3082980?t=1761898670","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761898670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082980/030427a8141cda244194a2dadae522185443ff7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761898670","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082980/030427a8141cda244194a2dadae522185443ff7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761898670","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Intense psychological horror\r\n\r\nDeath, torture, and graphic violence\r\n\r\nDark humor and dark romance\r\n\r\nCrude language and mature content\r\n\r\nDepictions of trauma, bullying, and emotional distress\r\n\r\nIntense gore and grotesque imagery\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082980/extras/77e400308dbdf7c47004f25bc92362a6.webp?t=1761898670\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082980/extras/77e400308dbdf7c47004f25bc92362a6.poster.avif?t=1761898670\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1024 height=1024 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Trapped: Forced to Kill?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TFTK is a psychological horror, mystery, and dark romance visual novel with over six different endings. You play as Ciara Mori. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve received an invitation to the best month of your life -\u00a0<strong>Evercrest Youth Retreat</strong>, where only the luckiest and most talented people are chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive just as the invitation says, enter the ominous door\u2026 and then everything becomes a blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're now tied up in a strange, dream-like place, that looks nothing like a Retreat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once freed, you discover you\u2019re trapped with <strong>eleven strangers</strong>, all as confused and terrified as you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form bonds, interact with your surroundings, make difficult choices and partake in a variety of <strong>twisted Killing Games</strong>\u2014from role-based card games to torture challenges, sacrifice activities, and trust-testing trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Evercrest Youth Retreat\u00a0</strong>has it all\u2026 and it wants you to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among the fear, sparks of <strong>forbidden romance</strong> ignite- particularly between the protagonist and one of the players - Ash. Romance is strictly forbidden here, but will they find a way around it? And will they be able to escape and live happily ever after together? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lurking behind it all is your captor, Akira, whose motives are cruel, cunning...and strangely personal. Could Ciara Mori's past hold the key to his obsession?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to face despair, heartbreak, and the dark allure of love in a place built to destroy you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the games, survive your choices, and uncover the truth\u2026 about the school, your captor, and even yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> to support development and be the first to experience the full story &lt;3</p>","developers":["TJ'S Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082980/c2e7c48ade2e3a838cb144e37b233748f0682f15/header.jpg?t=1761898670","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL or DirectX with at least 1GB  of RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3082980/734386150/30a3e9206fbc387c889ccfff97c1751095e1535a/176189